    {
      "decision_id": "DEC-0005",
      "step": "design",
      "selected": {},
      "reason": "Candidates rejected: (1) RmEC vs WmEC in WT = baseline muscle-bed difference (paper's 782 DEGs), not exercise; (2) WT vs Atf4 dEC = genotype effect; (3) genotype x muscle interaction = ATF4 dependence of the bed difference. None estimates an exercise effect. Metadata and paper agree that no sample was labelled exercised vs sedentary.",
      "method": "llm",
      "alternatives": [],
      "evidence_ids": [
        "SRC-0002",
        "SRC-0001",
        "ART-0006"
      ],
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "details": {
        "decision_status": "refused",
        "execution_status": "not_run",
        "stop_reason": "No exercise contrast exists in GSE174785: the 20 samples differ only by muscle bed (soleus/oxidative vs EDL/glycolytic) and EC-specific Atf4 genotype (WT vs Atf4 dEC); there is no sedentary vs exercised (wheel running) label, no pre/post or time factor, and GEO treatment_protocol mentions only tamoxifen. The paper's exercise comparison is the scRNA-seq dataset GSE158984 (S2.5.p1), not this one. RmEC vs WmEC is a muscle-type comparison, not an exercise effect, so analysing it would answer a different estimand than 'how exercise affects gene expression'."
      },
      "recorded_at": "2026-11-03T00:30:42"
